[Script Info]
; Captions burned into hazel-probes-intro.mp4 (the Probes tutorial's intro video). Its voiceover reads
; them aloud: scripts/intro_voiceover.txt has one spoken line per caption, at the caption's start time.
; To change the captions, edit the Dialogue lines below, then from the repo root run
;   python3 scripts/render_intro_captions.py      (needs ffmpeg and Pillow; writes a silent video)
;   scripts/render_intro_voiceover.py              (needs Kokoro; adds the voice; see its header)
; Positions: \pos is the center of the caption box. (938,272) sits right of the code before Auto Probe
; turns on at 59.17s; (938,530) sits in the blank area beside the case rules after that.
