Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.40,0:00:06.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(938,272)}A quick preview of programming\Nwith live probes in Hazel.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.00,0:00:13.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(938,272)}The tutorial then covers Hazel\Nand each probe feature in detail.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.00,0:00:17.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(938,272)}First, manual probes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.20,0:00:19.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(938,272)}Right-click any expression\Nor pattern...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.30,0:00:21.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(938,272)}...and choose Add probe\N(or press Cmd/Ctrl+E).
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.40,0:00:24.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(938,272)}Its value appears at the end\Nof the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.60,0:00:30.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(938,272)}Not just variables: here,\Nan arithmetic expression...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.50,0:00:33.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(938,272)}...and here, a whole case\Nexpression.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.50,0:00:37.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(938,272)}By default, a probe shows\None value at a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.00,0:00:40.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(938,272)}With a sample selected, press\NSpace for Many mode...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.30,0:00:43.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(938,272)}...which shows every value\Nfrom the run.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.60,0:00:49.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(938,272)}Click a sample to make it\Nthe focus...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.00,0:00:55.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(938,272)}...and the other probes highlight\Ntheir samples from that same call.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.70,0:00:59.17,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(938,272)}Rather than placing every\Nprobe by hand...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.17,0:01:04.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(938,530)}...press Cmd/Ctrl+P to turn\Non Auto Probe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.40,0:01:09.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(938,530)}It puts one probe on each line\Nthat has something to probe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.20,0:01:17.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(938,530)}Unlike some other environments,\NHazel runs incomplete programs.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.30,0:01:19.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(938,530)}This hole is the unfinished\Nbody of watering_amount.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.80,0:01:22.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(938,530)}Each call returns that hole,\Nwhich the tests show too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.80,0:01:25.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(938,530)}Start typing...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.00,0:01:32.29,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(938,530)}...and the feedback stays live,\Neven while the code is incomplete.
